() Tj T*
(After approval, travelers book rail and lodging through the company portal. A hotel may) Tj T*
(cost up to 180 dollars per night before tax. The limit is 240 dollars in Harbor City) Tj T*
(during the annual November summit.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
